	(text "1. R3 sets the U3 current limit: 6800 / 12k = ~570 mA\n    on the calculator VBUS.\n2. R1 and R2 must stay separate 5.1k pull-downs\n    (USB-C sink detection).\n3. IO35-IO37 belong to the N16R8 octal PSRAM.\n    GPIO3/45/46 are strapping pins. Leave all unconnected.\n4. ESP-IDF enables the D+/D- host pull-downs inside\n    the S3; no external resistors.\n5. U1 antenna must overhang the board edge."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 274.32 119.38 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
			(justify left top)
		)
		(uuid "0a4de656-3485-4d76-970c-7d5074a2aef5")
	)
